    "Needs a mature sand bed with plenty of natural detritus; one per tank, or they run out of food.",
    "If it dies, or is badly stressed or bitten, it releases holothurin, a poison that can kill the fish. Run carbon and take a dead one out fast.",
    "Can be sucked into uncovered pump intakes; cover them with a sponge.",
